    "description": "<p>This Charm expands Hypnotic Tongue Technique, increasing its duration to one month. If the Solar has Essence 4+, she can make the cost five Willpower to resist when the first opportunity to fulfill the order arises (in lieu of one Willpower per day), after which the Charm ends. Finally, if the Lawgiver has Essence 5+, the mote cost to activate Hypnotic Tongue Technique is only the target's Essence rating instead of 10m. This Charm improves Hypnotic Tongue Technique but otherwise works the same as its Abyssal Mirror.</p>",
